      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00895",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "棱线的光，忽地消失了……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The light along the ridge suddenly vanished...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00895",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "整个风景眼看着沉入了黑暗。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The whole landscape sank into darkness before his eyes.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00895",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "不知何时，风也止住了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "At some point, the wind had stopped too.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00895",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "这样，薄雾一定又会开始强劲起来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "With that, the thin mist would surely begin to thicken again.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00895",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "天突然黑了下来，大概也是这个关系吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The sky had suddenly darkened, probably for the same reason.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
